{"id":"steam-772410","steam":772410,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Max and Maya: Cat simulator","summary":"Max and Maya is the first kickass cat RPG-simulator! The Apocalypse came by surprise and unexpected. Toxic shawarma turned almost all people into zombies. Only cats are immune to the virus. This cannot be tolerated!","about":"Max and Maya is the first realistic alpha-cat simulator, which markets the secret ambition of your pets: All Power to the Cats! You're in for a fascinating story.  Where have all people gone? Is there a way to defeat rats and dogs? Why nobody feeds me anymore? It's time to boost your skills, defeat your enemies and build a real cat fort! Of course, you can take a nap anytime, and if anyone wakes you up, your sacred duty is to piss on their slippers.\r\nGather a feline army and conquer the world!\r\n \r\nFeatures:\r\n \r\nYou’re a cat\r\nWhat else do you need?\r\nMeow-magic\r\nConnect your mic. Now you can command cat and cast spells using voice! With right meow-phrases, of course. \r\nBuild cat-fort\r\nThis time cats will conquer the world. Literally. Train your cat army and unleash it on streets of city!\r\nUse waste\r\nEat crap, drink from puddles, and then pee and throw poop at your enemies.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/772410/portrait.png?t=1524043312","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/772410/header.jpg?t=1524043312","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/772410/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1524043312","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/772410/header.jpg?t=1524043312","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/772410/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1524043312","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/772410/ss_a448010154737ef2d61c8a8ea29d314a610050ad.600x338.jpg?t=1524043312